OL,3,GNEWSARetrial for gas worker over fatal
OL,4,Aexplosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retrial has been ordered for a man
OL,7,Faccused of gross negligence
OL,8,Fmanslaughter after a fatal gas
OL,9,Fexplosion.
OL,11,FTen people died following an explosion
OL,12,Fat Haut du Mont flats in Jersey in the
OL,13,Fearly hours of 10 December 2022. Lee
OL,14,FWard denied 10 counts of the charge and
OL,15,Fjurors were previously unable to reach
OL,16,Fa verdict and were discharged.
OL,18,FGas workers Neil Armstrong and John
OL,19,FWright were found guilty of the same
OL,20,Fcharges and Island Energy was found
OL,21,Fguilty of health and safety breaches.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
