OL,3,GNEWSARetrial for gas worker over fatal
OL,4,Aexplosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey will be sentenced over four days
OL,7,Fbetween 26 and 29 January. Jersey's
OL,8,FAttorney General ordered the retrial
OL,9,Ffor Ward at Jersey's Royal Court on
OL,10,FFriday.
